<?php elseif ($type === 'faq'): $questions = [['What does this preview show?', 'The new frontend layouts use clearly labelled examples until an approved read-only content source is connected. Existing content, settings and bookings are not changed.'], ['Does an inquiry confirm a booking?', 'No. A planning inquiry and itinerary review remain separate from the business booking-confirmation process. No inquiry or confirmation is submitted from this preview.'], ['Can I explore without JavaScript?', 'Core links, content, GET filters and native disclosures work without JavaScript. Demo message and inquiry fields remain disabled rather than sending a fallback request.'], ['Are the sample trips available to book?', 'No. Their titles, illustrative durations and layouts are design examples, not published travel offers, prices or availability.'], ['Where will the real FAQs come from?', 'The existing approved FAQ content and publication rules remain the source of truth. These preview questions explain the interface and are not a replacement for the business FAQs.']]; ?>
